{"id":10000090,"name":"夏沃蕾","enName":"Chevreuse","title":"明律决罚","element":"火","region":"枫丹","rarity":4,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"1月10日","constellation":"剑铳座","description":"时刻恪守着心中「正义」的特巡队队长，手中的铳枪只会指向负罪之人。","affiliation":"特巡队","cv":{"chinese":"潘丹妮","japanese":"下地紫野","english":"艾丽卡·林德贝克","korean":"蔡敏智"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000090-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000090-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Chevreuse.zip","voicePackageEn":"Chevreuse","quoteCount":70,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"我是枫丹特巡队队长夏沃蕾，寒暄就免了，有什么棘手的案件需要处理吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/4rfq9b4km7ewcvdneliiz6eqpmr09z8.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·铳枪","desc":"铳枪是我最喜欢的武器，它具有强大的杀伤力和威慑力。有些时候，后者甚至比前者更有用。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/cdv0wrrc93m3ua4gdx5i06l4s702c1l.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·巡逻","desc":"我们特巡队并不参与枫丹廷的日常巡视工作，我们追捕的人，也不可能在大街上露面。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/16/q15lw7ns1od730jh90ns29mgxs4cxoy.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·食物","desc":"「圈圈圆圆」这种零食便于携带，还可以搭配酱汁，尝出不同风味…等着，我去买几份回来。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/42/h6x4j4y5bvjxp09u5fhrjcf1tdl92co.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"放心，即使是在雨里，我的铳枪依旧能够正常开火。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/30/rcnoxg1an1jlkkx73ksz4is3f54vo7k.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"有些罪犯会用雷鸣声来掩盖枪声，但这骗不过我的耳朵。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e1/5186w4vbsvfp05f9g1zu071n77vz1pk.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"…等等，我要维护一下铳枪。以免它的机关结构被冻住。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/s33lnukvyyjgoaq0d8o7w08d1qqlsry.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"天气不错，视野良好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/0k5lggq9i9fml2nwkvprx9fbat8e6zt.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"这种风速…只怕连出膛的子弹也会被吹歪。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ab/hnyu7g0lpuo89z3azuhg6ipzjvycgt5.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"广阔的沙漠，很适合掩埋某些事物。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/61/2j9e94xv9nhui1locr4sv4ib8jug4dd.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早上好，我刚准备去做几组体能训练，要一起吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/bd2ta0vpywu5ro6vciyrrd3sln5x8jf.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"中午好，要和我一起去特巡队食堂吃饭吗？那里的饭菜很适合填饱肚子。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/nt9tmxusu8oegltftm0ue9o7n5xiv8h.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"今天的工作总算结束了，而且没出什么大乱子，我们去吃点夜宵吧，我来带路。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8f/ea0670j4ml2mntskp577q8wv4dswrbl.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"晚安。我稍后也会去休息，希望…今晚不要发生太多紧急事态。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/tcqs7tgffeyjjfbdp22p45bzy3pat0w.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏沃蕾自己·特巡队","desc":"特巡队专门应对各类危急凶案和恶劣罪犯，所以，我们在执法时会相对…强硬一些。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/l2rg5ilw67yvwobt0puefcuha34e9e3.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏沃蕾自己·帽子","desc":"在特巡队里，有一个不成文的规定。如果一个队员牺牲了，那我们就会将他的帽子保存起来，如果他的后代也成为了特巡队员，我们会将这顶帽子授予他的后代…这也算是一种「传承」吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f1/shlq77ihu8xf0tev2nyq6cldsnrdzbp.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·兴趣","desc":"我会在空闲时读一些「犯罪小说」。和推理小说不同的是，犯罪小说并不会去设计复杂的犯罪手法，而是着重描写围绕罪案发生的各色人情纠葛和情绪冲突，在我看来还挺有趣的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/43/bu5y2oo815qtt85v5mw1atrr8uw2o5u.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·法理","desc":"如果你对法理有什么疑问，可以随时来问我，或者说…当你的脑子里出现「也许这件事并不算违法」的念头时，必须第一时间来和我商量。\n每年都有不少蠢货因为侥幸心理而踏过红线，我可不愿意看见你成为那种人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/gnzv6bjl9yqmg904iad4j6f04qryomm.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"在我的工作中，「神之眼」确实是一种不可忽视的武力辅助。有了它之后，我的铳枪再也没有发生过严重故障。\n「同时持有神之眼和铳枪的特巡队队长」，这些名头加起来，应该能够吓倒一些胆小的嫌疑人了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/f11ovf5lh6yyth4k3r7dp4qoxc7h2fy.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"汉考特竟然真的逮捕了米莉丝…面对挚爱之人也能下得去手，让人钦佩。但是米莉丝做错了什么呢？她只是变卖了一件捡到的首饰而已，就变成了贵族口中十恶不赦的罪人…正义真让人捉摸不透，你觉得呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/rdeaf2i63mro6qe712ejs7ke031gyxf.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻·警卫机关","desc":"虽然我们隶属于执律庭，但特巡队执行任务时，并不会大量启用警卫机关。至于为什么…呵，那些笨重的机关，只会挡住我们射出的子弹。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/1nc0b3furhygjfw76u2ipf3exlersn3.mp3"},{"title":"关于娜维娅…","desc":"我听说过和娜维娅小姐父亲有关的那件谋杀案，当时在执律庭也闹得沸沸扬扬，不少人都因为这件案件而吵个不停…\n好在如今案件已然昭雪，真正的凶犯也已经伏法…「正义」总算是正式入席了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_navia_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/dncm3qr62102o813oqftzwa7mnq69zy.mp3"},{"title":"关于林尼…","desc":"我认识这位大魔术师。有一次我们逮捕了一位涉嫌故意伤害、拐骗和谋杀的魔术师，却一直弄不清他的犯罪手法。最后还是请来了林尼先生做顾问，才找到了关键物证，顺利将嫌疑人定了罪。听说一位小说家对这件罪案很感兴趣，写了一本用魔术手法犯罪的推理小说。\n不过…小说的细节描述实在太过详细，现在还处于脱敏期，暂时是无法出版了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_lyney_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/97jefx43ofcr2th1n9ysfdlulm7dvtv.mp3"},{"title":"关于菲米尼…","desc":"我有一次出门买零件的时候遇见过这位潜水员，当时我们都想要买下店里剩下的唯一一个通用零件。我刚想说把那枚零件让给他，但他却一下子缩回了手，低着头一路小跑出了店里。说难听点，简直像个犯人一样…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_freminet_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/lqk5pt2zzehbdr8c02qssj63zig6r1g.mp3"},{"title":"关于克洛琳德…","desc":"这位决斗代理人在枫丹廷可是大名鼎鼎啊。我们两人职务不同，我不会随意评价她的工作。但我相信，她接下那些代理决斗的原因，都是发自她内心的「正义」。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_clorinde_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/38b9c9zwuas0m5lssgt9yyoelpmwas5.mp3"},{"title":"关于莱欧斯利…","desc":"莱欧斯利先生的工作卓有成效。至少罪人们都清楚地知道，「梅洛彼得堡」并不是一个养老的好去处。这对我们的审讯工作提供了很大帮助。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_wriothesley_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/dum6425jrmy87w2de98wkjgr6rqv7vh.mp3"},{"title":"关于艾梅莉埃…","desc":"我俩私交不错，我有好几次请她用专业的化学知识来帮我分析物证、追缉凶犯。她还能帮忙发现很多看不见的信息，比如犯人用了什么香水、送过什么花，甚至去过什么地方、踩过什么泥土…她从没错过。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_emilie_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/49i6m5l7wd5lfbexgiosizmwldq57bt.mp3"},{"title":"关于千织…","desc":"千织处理纠纷的方式有些激进。但她凭借自己的门路和人脉，为特巡队提供过很多次情报。作为回礼，我会在她把人丢出店门、或是掀翻恶性竞争对手的店铺时睁一只眼闭一只眼。事后调查你会发现，千织总是有理的那一方。她只是懒得和人废话罢了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_chiori_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d2/k3559ee12lhrhd3rsjjtrjm0g0oi35m.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏洛蒂…","desc":"这是一位让人头疼的记者小姐。每次重案发生后，无论我们怎么封锁现场，她都能第一时间出现在最近的地方…有次我的一名手下甚至把她列为了第一嫌疑人，羁押了足足半个月，但她还是在拘留室里写完了报道…我要找个时间，正式和她的主编谈谈了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_charlotte_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/gfep49av00tfgveiipvampphkv0phbl.mp3"},{"title":"关于希格雯…","desc":"特巡队和美露莘的交情由来已久。我们经常和逐影庭里的美露莘合作。她们善良、诚实又可靠，在处理某些重案时，还能发挥无可替代的作用…而我个人，也和几位美露莘关系不错。希格雯护士长就是其中一位。\n从过去到现在，美露莘都是我们不可或缺的同伴。如果…再有任何人胆敢用任何方式污蔑中伤她们，那么特巡队的枪口，绝不会留情。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_sigewinne_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/exx3odoi8jgv7j510m3qzicihbpojke.mp3"},{"title":"关于那维莱特…","desc":"众人皆知，最高审判官大人在审判时全无私情。有人说他少了点人情味，但在我看来，正义本就不该被人情干扰。违律者即有罪，仅此而已。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_neuvillette_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/s8s82qc70vzpxwe1ektwx2q1ozfuwop.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"芙宁娜大人…有段时间突然指定我们进行什么…花枪表演训练。她不仅要求我们全员装配一种特制的「礼仪铳枪」，还要接受特殊的舞枪训练…还好，因为她始终找不到喜欢的仪仗曲，这件事就草草作罢了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b0/2hmcmsqn11nksz4mbqunwbrn1x92s67.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解夏沃蕾·其一","desc":"抱歉，我并不擅长和人交际。或者说…和正常人交际。如果你有什么想问的，直接问就是。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/29/2qbd7j5sxafodv368m88i2un7a8t078.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解夏沃蕾·其二","desc":"特巡队是隶属于执律庭的多个执法部门之一。因为我们的行事风格和人员组成都非常大胆，在执律庭某些先生嘴里，我们是「最不守规矩」的部门。\n但是，我认为特巡队的行事准则不应受外界影响。我们要对付的恶徒可不是沫芒宫里的好好先生。如果罪人的违法乱纪来得像暴雨一样突然，那我们也绝不能慢他们半拍。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/rg1hclf7vqusmbk6o0xkg33ja144z0m.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解夏沃蕾·其三","desc":"我接触的犯罪者，并非全是穷凶极恶的歹徒或恶匪。\n更多的人，最开始都只是犯下了一个小错，他们害怕为此负责，想要悄悄补救，却在不自觉中陷入了谎言的漩涡，最后…在无数谎言的挟裹下，身不由己地走上了犯罪的歧途。\n我最喜欢的那位剧作家曾经在一台歌剧里写道：「谎言是生发罪行的恶土」。\n但是，他自己却在几年后因为剽窃罪而被捕…真是给那台歌剧做了一个戏剧性的注脚。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/ihzoalh24v3zozf6xkog82jxajivhfq.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解夏沃蕾·其四","desc":"我的父亲受过牢狱之灾，我曾被称作「罪人的女儿」。我还在灰河长大，见过不少太阳光照不到的角落。托这些经历的福，讨厌我的人有不少，但我学会的东西更多。\n执法者要相信自己心中的「正义」，并且将其付诸在自己的行动中…这是父亲教导我的话。\n我也深以为然。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/8ajecehwelh74dyrkguk5cytalwg9t8.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解夏沃蕾·其五","desc":"实不相瞒，作为特巡队队长，我见过很多毫无道德底线可言的恶人胡作非为，也见过无辜与善良之人卷入事件受伤，甚至付出生命。我常常感到愤怒与无力。\n我坚信「罪人」应当受到惩罚，但这并不意味着无尽的复仇循环。\n如果我们蒙蔽双眼，任由情感驱使自身的行为，迟早都会溺亡在冬天的海水里。\n越是掌握权力，就越该警惕这一点。坚定追寻自己心中的「正义」，但万不可迷失在追寻它的路上。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/28m0gtdbdw4lfyjuh4v5rxm95kdxt7w.mp3"},{"title":"夏沃蕾的爱好…","desc":"训练？射击？非要说的话…看犯罪小说吧。对了，我要去拿最新一期的《谜案寻踪》了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/q2vn6e6o67lzkokdeanfemibkvji7uf.mp3"},{"title":"夏沃蕾的烦恼…","desc":"不要再让我学习那些繁琐的礼仪了，与其将时间浪费在这上面，我宁愿去盯防凶犯。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/k6hrtac0zai3jcmb90hmcxtxpsatdkp.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"富含油脂和糖分的食物，可以在工作日为我提供充足的能量，还有好心情。休息日？休息日的话，它们就沦为了会增长体重的「罪恶食品」，而将此等「罪恶」消灭，同样能带给我一天的好心情。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/09/hronmdhqq59cy3xoegnk0okeewk660a.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"我…不太能接受生冷食物。既然是要入口的东西，至少要做得全熟才行…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/1chgi6vtyc4r6819a74i45uju09nit7.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"很不错。不过…呵，就是我不由自主地吃太多，等会要加练了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0d/033fw2jeifmbekk0b7ot31jil0nsl4t.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"嗯，比特巡队食堂的饭菜味道好多了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/apn4so0g9rh3jbo2cup4cjbiputv885.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"足够填饱肚子，也不会勾起额外的食欲…这道菜对我来说非常优秀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7a/jiunlzm39su1rl7tbj6uzosb1o5rown.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐。嗯…立正！站直一些，不要屈膝。我要测量一下你的身体数据，给你订做一柄便携的小型铳枪，还有速拔枪套…\n好了，放松。在铳枪做好之前，我先带着你用训练铳枪打一段时间的靶。现在就开始，跟我走。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/n6360oeh0vrd07uudv2wjbe2bi48d95.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"不错。端枪的手更稳了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/0cjkpc0nj2kxkpza8r9rnacwzq5o0px.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"这样的话，也许能狙击到更远的敌人…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/fmjrfq0isa14uaqdcgvy0m3fzbw1vfv.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"多谢，有了这样的力量，追缉恶徒就更有效率了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4b/asdo6vpwj02f0tcc78ig5on5sctuj7w.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"感谢你为我提供的所有帮助…虽然我不能承诺特巡队随时听你差遣，但就我个人来说，只要你开口，我就会与你同行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dc/49byz4npaazxpb07zb3nb3i2bm0ebz1.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"不许动！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/6d8mzgymbp6ll56dpqpvkvk7u2cg3wn.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"放下武器！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/sdk469id6a3rhx9wjruhrwsi768e0gw.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"最后通牒！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fd/qjij04hruhegtz82zm6renevg3cn5e1.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"必要武力。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/mz5phn7rquizl0t0owgyxmzq4ppiorh.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"绳之以法。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/csqgsfcz1yaxezylsfuz3gfv5mh5fmu.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"束手就擒！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/89/ae2mu9kopk2vdi7s78cms9tptaub7w3.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"不错。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/1le72dzpswte2rc3gyo6k8cthnvjuwk.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"希望里面没有赃物。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/qg731lceu3v6iwhc3zb2vlfq31kyhbb.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"这不算是违法所得，放心吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c7/9b28a990oldpnb1wrbc2rrswui1dazt.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"恶徒…！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/th6ux0vwow6yhxsnllgpqjt4s5tlpkg.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"目无法纪。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/7ee61wynrteqrkwi3v48j1e399xx5ah.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"你，无权申辩了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/pocrirbnzrigaf9verysa3nya6g41ja.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"稳住队列！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/16/q0lzs9xktk0xnputgvjr7lfvw0sowsd.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"保持阵型！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/8be9i9nw5vj265stfiv1dg8m48je862.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"正义…何在…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/hn9uxebcqrk5t6kmhg6r1rnylpy45me.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"罪人…尚未…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/6273w7xoenk40fqwcbrfgta53oybjg7.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"这就是…结局吗…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/eiquwh6edrm7780lf2w6u05lenospzn.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"无用顽抗…！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chevreuse/vo_chevreuse_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/94/kq3ioaixn0na05hjdjl5z6k9iu555bc.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"出动吧。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_chevreuse_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/0nr5yytala6fysshbfxj5ewqz1pwww0.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"就当是加练。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_chevreuse_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/61vqht95ijze8cv4jpqggj5bjpakryf.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"我随时准备着。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_chevreuse_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/la4j25st8hm867zas9pu3nt0xhi3vjz.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000090-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000090-full.webp","fullArtWidth":893,"fullArtHeight":896}